{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55258","headline":"判酒务吏乞以家财修夫子庙（题拟） · 同州判官","name":"判酒务吏乞以家财修夫子庙（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆棘森森遶杏坛，儒官高贵尽偷安。\n若教酒务修夫子，觉我惭惶也大难。\n（见宋陶岳《五代史补》卷三。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷八七○据《古今诗话》收此诗归冯道幕客，廿八字中有十八字不同，虽爲一诗，而辗转相传，已失初）（貌。\n今据最早记录该诗的《五代史补》重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"同州判官","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}